{
  "about": [
    "Test vectors for the friends stream (docs/network/08-friends-stream.md), for any implementation.",
    "elements: each element's XML in the one form this crate writes, and its fields. Reading the XML gives the fields; writing the fields gives the XML.",
    "captured: the friends service's own elements in the forms its traffic showed: white space before '/>' and '>', a space after a closing tag, lower-case hex. The character names are made up; a ticket, and the lists, are replaced by this protocol's, in the same form. Each reads as its fields and writes as canonical.",
    "skipped: what a reader ignores or reads leniently, and what it reads instead.",
    "malformed: text a reader refuses; on a stream, the reader says Bye with Reason protocol and closes.",
    "frames: a stream's bytes in hex (preamble: they begin with it) and the frames they hold; bad_frames: bytes that close the stream.",
    "tickets: the a1. form of an account and its secret; bad_tickets: strings not of that form.",
    "fields: element is the element's name; cx and hr are 0x and lower-case hex; numbers are numbers; an optional value left out is null; unknown is true for an element this version does not know."
  ],
  "limits": {
    "max_frame": 65536,
    "ping_secs": 20,
    "silence_secs": 70,
    "hello_deadline_secs": 10,
